an><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,T\\in V\">\\(L,T\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_L:\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}_S)\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_L:\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}_S)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Theory}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"90ce6acf0c65af45\" href=\"?note=90ce6acf0c65af45\" title=\"./58-df-theory.md\">58-df-theory.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"6996aaff4caeacce\" href=\"?note=6996aaff4caeacce\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-consistency.md\">../batch13/58-df-consistency.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> (provability relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"582b96e73e5d1c6e\" href=\"?note=582b96e73e5d1c6e\" title=\"./58-df-provable.md\">58-df-provable.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel6CompleteTheory}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel6CompleteTheory}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}complete\\text{-}theory} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel6CompleteTheory}_S(L,T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Theory}(T,L)\\land\\mathrm{Con}_S(T)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\;\\left(\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)=\\emptyset\\to\\left(((T\\vdash\\varphi)\\lor(T\\vdash\\neg\\varphi))\\land\\neg((T\\vdash\\varphi)\\land(T\\vdash\\neg\\varphi))\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}complete\\text{-}theory} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel6CompleteTheory}_S(L,T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Theory}(T,L)\\land\\mathrm{Con}_S(T)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\;\\left(\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)=\\emptyset\\to\\left(((T\\vdash\\varphi)\\lor(T\\vdash\\neg\\varphi))\\land\\neg((T\\vdash\\varphi)\\land(T\\vdash\\neg\\varphi))\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Completeness decides every sentence; consistency excludes simultaneous proofs. Deductive closure is not silently added to the weak upstream notion of theory.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"90ce6acf0c65af45","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./58-df-theory.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-pr